{
  "slug": "playground",
  "name": "Playground",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Creates interactive HTML playgrounds — self-contained single-file explorers with visual controls, live preview, and prompt output with copy button. Includes templates for design playgrounds, data explorers, concept maps, and document critique.",
  "longDescription": "Provides a playground skill with **6 templates**:\n\n- **`code-map`**: codebase structure visualization\n- **`concept-map`**: knowledge exploration\n- **`data-explorer`**: SQL/API/regex query building\n- **`design-playground`**: component and layout prototyping\n- **`diff-review`**: line-by-line PR commenting\n- **`document-critique`**: approve/reject/comment workflow\n\nEach generates a self-contained single-file HTML with live controls, instant preview, and a copy-to-clipboard prompt for iterating with Claude.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
